abstract: |
  This repository contains the complete code and results for the paper:
  "A Reproducible Ensemble Learning Framework for 12‑Lead ECG Classification 
  of Myocardial Ischemia and Infarction".
  The project implements a systematic hyperparameter search and ensemble 
  learning approach to develop a robust Teacher model for 12‑lead ECG 
  classification, with comprehensive results including accuracy, sensitivity, 
  specificity, and AUC on the PTB‑XL dataset.

